WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:01.786
Meet PowerPoint2Vid.

00:00:01.786 --> 00:00:06.649
It turns a PowerPoint deck into a narrated explainer video, right in your browser.

00:00:08.149 --> 00:00:09.739
You already wrote the story.

00:00:09.739 --> 00:00:12.409
It lives in your slides and your speaker notes.

00:00:12.409 --> 00:00:14.794
But recording a video by hand takes hours.

00:00:14.794 --> 00:00:16.044
There is a faster way.

00:00:17.544 --> 00:00:18.384
Add your deck.

00:00:18.384 --> 00:00:19.885
Pick a voice and a style.

00:00:19.885 --> 00:00:20.545
Preview it.

00:00:20.545 --> 00:00:21.266
Then export.

00:00:21.266 --> 00:00:26.309
Your speaker notes become the script, and shapes animate in as each point is spoken.

00:00:27.809 --> 00:00:29.664
Everything runs in your browser.

00:00:29.664 --> 00:00:33.141
Nothing is uploaded, so your slides never leave your device.

00:00:33.141 --> 00:00:35.286
There is no sign-up and no watermark.

00:00:36.786 --> 00:00:38.197
Try it with your own deck.

00:00:38.197 --> 00:00:42.103
Head to powerpoint2vid.com and turn your slides into a video in minutes.

